WEBVTT

00:04:30.688 --> 00:04:31.848
OK. Good.

00:04:31.872 --> 00:04:33.211
(Laughter)

00:04:33.235 --> 00:04:34.842
But, besides being a black woman,

00:04:34.866 --> 00:04:37.528
I am different from most of you
in some other ways.

00:04:37.552 --> 00:04:40.943
I watched nearly half of the buildings
in my neighborhood burn down.

00:04:40.967 --> 00:04:42.930
My big brother Lenny fought in Vietnam,

00:04:42.954 --> 00:04:45.859
only to be gunned down
a few blocks from our home.

00:04:48.992 --> 00:04:50.247
Jesus.

00:04:50.271 --> 00:04:53.217
I grew up with a crack house
across the street.

00:04:54.796 --> 00:04:57.495
Yeah, I'm a poor black child
from the ghetto.

00:04:58.784 --> 00:05:00.951
These things make me different from you.